        "Description": "Hello Agent. Today Ether Biotech Corporation has hired you to take out any whistleblowers with insider knowlege about the Ether Virus that has exposed top secret information by telling members of the public, They have also ordered that you perform as neatly as possible, only killing the targets and not be caught doing any illegal actions whether that would be being seen or recorded via CCTV. Please treat this misson carefully and finally Good Luck.",
